              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Smart Care</span></span></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Your partner in digital transformation</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Through our SmartHospital Platform, we're unifying clinicians, patients, data and environments to drive digital transformation at scale to meet your evolving needs. Together, we're redefining care delivery across the continuum of care.<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jan 28 2026 17:32:26 GMT+0000",
