          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "chris.kleckner@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 09 2021 17:52:58 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Power to purchase</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Through our Flex Financial business we can help you acquire our full portfolio of products and offer numerous payment structures that can be customized to meet your budgetary needs.</span></p>\n<p><a title=\"View ProCare Services\" href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/services/flex-financial.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
